  "title": "Butternut Squash Risotto",
  "description": "This creamy butternut squash risotto is an easy, comforting risotto to make for those who love the naturally sweet flavor of tender butternut squash.",
  "authors": [
    "Andrea Longo Policella"
  ],
  "date_published": "2007-07-06T16:58:28-04:00",
